<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 68, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>为什么选这个题：收益是真的，数字不可全信</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF', opacity: 0.72 }}>01 · Problem</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 26, paddingBottom: 10, gap: 24 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', paddingTop: 13, paddingBottom: 13, paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>关键观察　</span>自助解决率的上限由知识库质量决定，而公开数据的口径普遍被放大——这决定了本项目必须“先治理、再谈效果”。
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, height: 178 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'flex-end' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>AI 增强知识库的自助解决率</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', marginTop: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#8B97A8', marginBottom: 14, marginRight: 10 }}>38% →</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 74, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1 }}>68%</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', marginBottom: 10, marginLeft: 6 }}>解决率</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>传统知识库 38% vs AI 增强 68%（Zendesk 2025）</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 1, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'flex-end' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>单次交互成本差</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', marginTop: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 74, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1 }}>50</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', marginBottom: 10, marginLeft: 6 }}>倍以上</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>人工工单 $8–25 vs 自助 $0.10–0.25（Zendesk 2025）</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 1, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'flex-end' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>严格口径下的真实拦截率</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', marginTop: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 74, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1 }}>20–30</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#D9534F', marginBottom: 10, marginLeft: 6 }}>%</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>无转人工且 72h 无重开；厂商案例常报 50–75%</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 132 }}>需求侧</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', flex: 1 }}>2025 年 72% 的企业 IT 组织已部署至少一项 AI 服务台能力，2022 年为 41%</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>Gartner</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 132 }}>真实瓶颈</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', flex: 1 }}>差距不在模型，在知识库质量：干净、去重、有归属的内容才检索得准</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>Gartner</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', width: 132 }}>最大风险</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', flex: 1 }}>不是答不出，是答错还自信：某产品拦截率最高，同时 200 题里错 8 题</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>2026 横评</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '4px solid #3D7BD9', paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 12, paddingLeft: 20, paddingRight: 20 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                因此本项目定两条主线：<span style={{ color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>治理</span>（谁能改、改了什么、能否回滚）与 <span style={{ color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>可验证</span>（有出处才答，没出处拒答）。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 50, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 8, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>企业内部技术支持知识库 · 课程作业汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>04 / 20</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
